OL,3,GNEWSA'Glamour gran' to make history at
OL,4,AMiss Great Britain beauty pageant
OL,5,
OL,6,FA grandmother who is set to make
OL,7,Fhistory at the Miss Great Britain
OL,8,Fbeauty pageant has said she wants other
OL,9,Fwomen to see that getting older does
OL,10,Fnot mean "disappearing".
OL,12,FAnn Marie Harper, 71, will be the
OL,13,Foldest contender to ever compete in the
OL,14,Fnational final in the competition's
OL,15,F81-year-history when she takes to the
OL,16,Fstage in the Classic category on
OL,17,FFriday.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,424,420,260,160,0,100
