OL,3,GNEWSA'Glamour gran' to make history at
OL,4,AMiss Great Britain beauty pageant
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe beauty queen from Prestwick,
OL,7,FAyrshire, who is best known to
OL,8,Fthousands of followers on social media
OL,9,Fas Glamour Gran Ann, won Ms Ayrshire GB
OL,10,FClassic in June to qualify for the
OL,11,Ffinal.
OL,13,F"For so many years I did not see myself
OL,14,Fas someone who could things like this,"
OL,15,FAnn Marie said.
